<h1>SlushIQ Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated: December 2025</strong></p>

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>
SlushIQ (“we”, “us”, “our”) is committed to protecting your privacy.
This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>use the SlushIQ mobile application (iOS or Android)</li>
  <li>visit our website or support pages</li>
  <li>participate in our communities (such as Reddit or social media)</li>
</ul>

<p>
SlushIQ is designed primarily as an offline frozen-drink calculator and recipe tool.
We intentionally collect as little information as possible, and we never sell user data.
</p>

<p>By using SlushIQ, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>SlushIQ collects very limited information, and only when necessary to operate the app or respond to user inquiries.</p>

<h3>2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
<p>We may receive:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Email address (only if you voluntarily subscribe to updates or contact us directly)</li>
  <li>Bug reports or feedback that you intentionally send</li>
</ul>
<p>The SlushIQ app does not require account creation and does not store personal information on our servers.</p>

<h3>2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
<p>When you use our website or app, certain technical information may be collected automatically, such as:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Device model, operating system version</li>
  <li>App version</li>
  <li>Anonymous performance or crash logs (via Apple/Google)</li>
  <li>Usage diagnostics if you opt in at the OS level</li>
</ul>
<p>This information is anonymous and cannot identify you.</p>

<h3>2.3 Information We Do NOT Collect</h3>
<p>SlushIQ does not collect:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Names</li>
  <li>Addresses</li>
  <li>Payment information</li>
  <li>Precise location</li>
  <li>Contacts</li>
  <li>Photos</li>
  <li>Entered recipes or ingredient data</li>
  <li>Drink mixes or session history</li>
  <li>Any personal identifiers</li>
</ul>

<p>SlushIQ performs all calculations locally on your device.</p>

<h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
<p>We use the limited data we collect only to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Improve app performance</li>
  <li>Fix bugs or diagnose crashes</li>
  <li>Respond to support inquiries</li>
  <li>Send updates (only if you opted in to email notifications)</li>
</ul>

<p>We do not sell, rent, or share your data with advertisers or third parties.</p>

<h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>

<h3>4.1 Apple App Store & Google Play Services</h3>
<p>Used for:</p>
<ul>
  <li>App distribution</li>
  <li>Crash reporting</li>
  <li>Analytics (aggregate, anonymous)</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.2 Formspree (Email Submissions)</h3>
<p>Your email is securely transmitted if you subscribe to updates through our website.  
We do not store email addresses inside the SlushIQ app.</p>

<h3>4.3 OpenAI (Brixley Chat Processing)</h3>
<p>
Brixley Chat uses the OpenAI API to interpret ingredient descriptions and provide mix recommendations.
When you use Brixley, the text you type is securely transmitted to OpenAI’s servers for processing.
</p>

<p>SlushIQ does <strong>not</strong> send:</p>
<ul>
  <li>personal identifiers</li>
  <li>account information</li>
  <li>device IDs</li>
  <li>email addresses</li>
  <li>analytics</li>
  <li>payment data</li>
</ul>

<p>OpenAI does <strong>not</strong> use API data to train their models.</p>

<p>Only the message text you submit is processed, and it is not stored by SlushIQ.</p>

<h3>4.4 No Advertising SDKs</h3>
<p>SlushIQ contains zero advertising libraries, trackers, or profiling tools.</p>

<h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Email submissions only as long as needed for communication</li>
  <li>Crash logs only as long as Apple/Google store them (typically 30–90 days)</li>
</ul>

<p>You may request deletion at any time.</p>

<h2>6. Data Security</h2>
<p>
We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect any information we handle.
However, no digital system is fully secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute protection.
</p>

<h2>7. Children’s Privacy</h2>
<p>
SlushIQ is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal data from minors.
If we learn that a child has submitted personal information, we will delete it promptly.
</p>

<h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
<p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Request access to your data</li>
  <li>Request deletion</li>
  <li>Opt out of communications</li>
  <li>Ask how your data is used</li>
</ul>

<p>To make a request, contact us at the email below.</p>

<h2>9. Updates to This Policy</h2>
<p>
We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes to the app or legal requirements.
Updates will be posted with a new “Last Updated” date.
</p>

<h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions or wish to request data deletion, contact us:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Email: <a href="mailto:slushiqapp@gmail.com">slushiqapp@gmail.com</a></li>
  <li>Website: <a href="https://www.slushiq.com">www.slushiq.com</a></li>
  <li>Reddit: <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/slushiq">r/slushiq</a></li>
</ul>

